      "target": "../sections/sec-012-211-set-class.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "An ODRL Policy of subclass Set represents any combination of Rules. The Set Policy subclass is also the default subclass of\nPolicy (if none is specified).\nExample Use Case: The below Set Policy shows the Permission to use the target Asset\nhttp//example.com/asset:9898.movie.",
