      "target": "../sections/sec-013-212-offer-class.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "An ODRL Policy of subclass Offer represents Rules that are being offered from assigner Parties. An Offer is typically used to\nmake available Policies to a wider audience, but does not grant any Rules.\nAn ODRL Policy of subclass Offer:\nMUST have one assigner property value (of type Party) to indicate the functional role in the same Rules.",
