      "target": "../sections/sec-019-222-part-of-property.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The partOf property is used to identify an AssetCollection that an Asset resource is a member of. The purpose is to explicitly\nexpress membership relationships between Assets and AssetCollections. This enables a Rule that is related to an AssetCollection\nto understand which individual Assets the Rule may apply to. In addition, the Asset/AssetCollection membership relationships\nmay potentially detect conflicts in Rules.\nExample Use Case: The below snippet shows some Dublin Core metadata describing a document. The odrl:partOf\nproperty asserts that the Asset http://example.com/asset:111.doc is a",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
