      "target": "../sections/sec-051-31-odrl-profile-purpose.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The ODRL Information Model serves as the core framework and vocabulary to express policies. The ODRL Core Vocabulary\n[odrl-vocab] articulates this set of vocabulary terms. An ODRL policy may be expressed using the ODRL Core Vocabulary, and\nthis represents the minimally supported policy expression.\nAn ODRL Profile MUST be defined to provide vocabulary terms (as scoped in the ODRL Profile Mechanism section) that can be\nused in ODRL policies requiring additional semantics. An ODRL Profile explicitly serves community needs by specifying the\nvocabulary terms they require to be supported in ODRL pol",
