      "content": "The basis for the deliverables for the Permissions & Obligations Expression Working Group are the reports created by the W3C\nODRL Community Group. The ODRL Community Group has developed a family of specifications to support innovative\nexpression of asset usage for the publication, distribution and consumption of content services. The final outputs of the ODRL\nCommunity Group were the ODRL Version 2.1 specifications that were a major update for ODRL and superseded the original\nODRL Version 1.1 [odrl] (published as a W3C NOTE).\nThe following documents are part of the ODRL Community Group report",
